        "sid": "1CH 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.6.12+2SA.6.13+2SA.6.14+2SA.6.15+2SA.6.16+2SA.6.17+2SA.6.18+2SA.6.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 6.12-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " David built houses for himself in the city of David; and he prepared a place for the ark of God, and pitched a tent for it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David said, “No one but the Levites may carry the ark of God, for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " chose them to carry the ark of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and to minister to him for ever.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David assembled all Israel at Jerusalem, to bring up the ark of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to its place, which he had prepared for it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David gathered together the sons of Aaron and the Levites: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the sons of Kohath, Uriel the chief, with a hundred and twenty of his brethren; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the sons of Merari, Asaiah the chief, with two hundred and twenty of his brethren; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the sons of Gershom, Joel the chief, with a hundred and thirty of his brethren; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the sons of Eli-zaphan, Shemaiah the chief, with two hundred of his brethren; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the sons of Hebron, Eliel the chief, with eighty of his brethren; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the sons of Uzziel, Amminadab the chief, with a hundred and twelve of his brethren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David summoned the priests Zadok and Abiathar, and the Levites Uriel, Asaiah, Joel, Shemaiah, Eliel, and Amminadab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said to them, “You are the heads of the fathers' houses of the Levites; sanctify yourselves, you and your brethren, so that you may bring up the ark of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, to the place that I have prepared for it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because you did not carry it the first time,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The meaning of the Hebrew word is uncertain",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God broke forth upon us, because we did not care for it in the way that is ordained.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the priests and the Levites sanctified themselves to bring up the ark of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Levites carried the ark of God upon their shoulders with the poles, as Moses had commanded according to the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David also commanded the chiefs of the Levites to appoint their brethren as the singers who should play loudly on musical instruments, on harps and lyres and cymbals, to raise sounds of joy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the Levites appointed Heman the son of Joel; and of his brethren Asaph the son of Berechiah; and of the sons of Merari, their brethren, Ethan the son of Kushaiah; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and with them their brethren of the second order, Zechariah, Ja-aziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Benaiah, Ma-aseiah, Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, and Mikneiah, and the gatekeepers Obed-edom and Je-iel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The singers, Heman, Asaph, and Ethan, were to sound bronze cymbals; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zechariah, Azi-el, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Ma-aseiah, and Benaiah were to play harps according to Alamoth; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, Mikneiah, Obed-edom, Je-iel, and Azaziah were to lead with lyres according to the Sheminith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chenaniah, leader of the Levites in music, should direct the music, for he understood it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Berechiah and Elkanah were to be gatekeepers for the ark. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shebaniah, Joshaphat, Nethanel, Amasai, Zechariah, Benaiah, and Eliezer, the priests, should blow the trumpets before the ark of God. Obed-edom and Jehiah also were to be gatekeepers for the ark.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David and the elders of Israel, and the commanders of thousands, went to bring up the ark of the covenant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " from the house of Obed-edom with rejoicing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And because God helped the Levites who were carrying the ark of the covenant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", they sacrificed seven bulls and seven rams. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David was clothed with a robe of fine linen, as also were all the Levites who were carrying the ark, and the singers, and Chenaniah the leader of the music of the singers; and David wore a linen ephod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So all Israel brought up the ark of the covenant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with shouting, to the sound of the horn, trumpets, and cymbals, and made loud music on harps and lyres.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.28"
            ]
